  "contentHtml": "<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">* 아래의 이야기는<br>2025.1.23. 광주창의융합교육원 과학교사 실험연수에서&#160;<br>선생님들과 논의한 내용을 기본으로 분석하였습니다.<br>(함께 논의해주신 광주 선생님들께 감사드립니다!)<br>&#160;<br>1. 자떨어뜨리기 탐구활동을 합니다.</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignLeft\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/8e651b5aeceabf2634d8985a04f38539fdcd2059\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"600\" height=\"338\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/8e651b5aeceabf2634d8985a04f38539fdcd2059\" data-origin-width=\"641\" data-origin-height=\"361\"></div><p style=\"text-align: justify;\">2. 심리학이론을 소개하고,<br>&#160; &#39;00 음악을 들으면 집중이 잘될까?&#39; 라는 주제로<br>&#160; 탐구설계를 하고 탐구보고서를 작성합니다.</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignLeft\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/49bb2b12d3f711a1fad7eb22ace83af719ca76f3\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"600\" height=\"335\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/49bb2b12d3f711a1fad7eb22ace83af719ca76f3\" data-origin-width=\"1050\" data-origin-height=\"587\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignLeft\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/571d63ae17b3792153c1bb2a157179606d660752\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"600\" height=\"337\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/571d63ae17b3792153c1bb2a157179606d660752\" data-origin-width=\"1043\" data-origin-height=\"586\"></div><p style=\"text-align: justify;\">3. A 모둠이 작성한 보고서를 B모둠과 서로 바꿔서&#160;<br>&#160; 빨간펜으로 피드백해줍니다.&#160;</p><div class=\"table-wrap\"><table data-ke-type=\"table\" data-ke-align=\"alignLeft\" style=\"width: 88.2723%; height: 527px;\" border=\"1\" data-ke-style=\"style0\"><tbody><tr style=\"height: 18px;\"><td style=\"width: 46.5952%; height: 18px; text-align: justify;\"><b>&#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160;원본 보고서(1)</b></td><td style=\"width: 41.6772%; height: 18px; text-align: justify;\"><b>&#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160;교사의 피드백(1)</b></td></tr><tr style=\"height: 509px;\"><td style=\"width: 46.5952%; height: 509px; text-align: justify;\"><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/cbf25ebfb49ff00f9ace4fe9b8bd173fac34ce27\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"330\" height=\"507\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/cbf25ebfb49ff00f9ace4fe9b8bd173fac34ce27\" data-origin-width=\"1728\" data-origin-height=\"2657\"></div></td><td style=\"width: 41.6772%; height: 509px; text-align: justify;\"><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/99b057ef2147f8ee7fbab3f69648c8d06c1ddeda\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"291\" height=\"520\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/99b057ef2147f8ee7fbab3f69648c8d06c1ddeda\" data-origin-width=\"687\" data-origin-height=\"1228\"></div></td></tr></tbody></table></div><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color: #EE2323;\">교사는 빨간펜으로 </span><br><span style=\"color: #EE2323;\">&#39;대조군이 없다는 것&#39;,&#160; &#39;음악을 들으면서인지, 아니면 들은 후인지&#39; 를 피드백해주었습니다.</span><br>&#160;<br>4. 원본 보고서를 미리 만들어 놓은 GPT 챗봇에 넣습니다.<br>&#160; &#160; (챗봇에 넣은 &#39;지침&#39;은 아래와 같습니다.)&#160;</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignLeft\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/00cd359df4ef8ebb7f21146945b17f475839797e\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"659\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/00cd359df4ef8ebb7f21146945b17f475839797e\" data-origin-width=\"922\" data-origin-height=\"494\"><div class=\"figcaption\">위 지침은 다른 보고서들을 10개 이상 넣어보면서 수정한 결과입니다.</div></div><p style=\"text-align: justify;\">5. 챗봇의 피드백 결과입니다.</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignLeft\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/bca7110c52b119e0691e8f7de4cbb8afb566ee72\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"677\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/bca7110c52b119e0691e8f7de4cbb8afb566ee72\" data-origin-width=\"918\" data-origin-height=\"483\"></div><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color: #EE2323;\">(분석)</span><br><span style=\"color: #EE2323;\">1. 선생님이 피드백 해주었던 &#39;대조군&#39;이 없음을 정확히 찾아내었고,</span><br><span style=\"color: #EE2323;\">2. 결과 반복의 부족, 결론 도출 과정의 논리적 부족을 잘 설명하였습니다.</span><br><span style=\"color: #EE2323;\">3. 이를 바탕으로 아래에 &#39;개선된 실험 계획&#39;을 제공하였습니다.</span></p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignLeft\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/24e701128b55f0e4941a288e607b14b280b86bd7\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"659\" height=\"466\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/24e701128b55f0e4941a288e607b14b280b86bd7\" data-origin-width=\"908\" data-origin-height=\"642\"></div><p style=\"text-align: justify;\">--------------------------------------------------------------------------------<br>&#160;<br>7. (실습) 이번에는 재과만 선생님들께 드리는 피드백 문제입니다.&#160;<br><span style=\"color: #EE2323;\">&#160; 아래의 &#39;챗봇의 피드백&#39;을 보지 마시고, <br> 선생님께서 피드백 해보셔요~</span></p><div class=\"table-wrap\"><table data-ke-type=\"table\" data-ke-align=\"alignCenter\" style=\"width: 100%; height: 522px;\" border=\"1\" data-ke-style=\"style0\"><tbody><tr style=\"height: 20px;\"><td style=\"width: 50.0%; height: 20px; text-align: justify;\"><b><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">&#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160;원본 보고서(2)</span></b></td><td style=\"width: 50.0%; height: 20px; text-align: justify;\"><b><span style=\"color: #006DD7;\">&#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160;교사의 피드백(2) </span></b></td></tr><tr style=\"height: 502px;\"><td style=\"width: 50.0%; height: 502px; text-align: justify;\"><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/046e772a84a48cc02a413fb138d4dcc0261c569a\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/046e772a84a48cc02a413fb138d4dcc0261c569a\" data-origin-width=\"917\" data-origin-height=\"1223\"></div></td><td style=\"width: 50.0%; height: 502px; text-align: justify;\"><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/69c6110c623fe11df3dcf534849271e5e51a3405\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/69c6110c623fe11df3dcf534849271e5e51a3405\" data-origin-width=\"954\" data-origin-height=\"1297\"></div></td></tr></tbody></table></div><p style=\"text-align: justify;\">&#160;<br>8. 챗봇의 피드백 결과입니다.</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignLeft\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/871eddce463236b0aaad0f93bee4bf3558487d68\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"672\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/871eddce463236b0aaad0f93bee4bf3558487d68\" data-origin-width=\"939\" data-origin-height=\"319\"><div class=\"figcaption\"></div></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignLeft\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/2a9be6a00770cbeb2debd0a056c7be53220404a4\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"674\" height=\"249\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/2a9be6a00770cbeb2debd0a056c7be53220404a4\" data-origin-width=\"922\" data-origin-height=\"340\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignLeft\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/1377f91eb4859bced4df2402ccd88c752c8d0707\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"670\" height=\"280\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/1377f91eb4859bced4df2402ccd88c752c8d0707\" data-origin-width=\"917\" data-origin-height=\"383\"></div><p style=\"text-align: justify;\">&#160;<br><b><span style=\"color: #EE2323;\">(논의 및 활용가능성)</span></b><br><b><span style=\"color: #EE2323;\">1. &#39;AI가 교사(인간)보다 피드백을 잘할까?&#39; 라는 의문으로 선생님들과 탐구를 시작했습니다.</span></b><br>&#160;<br><b><span style=\"color: #EE2323;\">2.&#160; AI의 피드백이 상당히 정확하고, 의미있음을 알 수 있었습니다.&#160; &#160; &#160;</span></b><br>&#160;<br><b><span style=\"color: #EE2323;\">3. 1:1 &#39;보조교사&#39; 로서 활용가능성 :&#160; 모둠별로 작성한 계획서 or 보고서 초안을&#160;</span></b><br><b><span style=\"color: #EE2323;\">&#160; &#160;챗봇이 알려주는 &#39;개선할 점&#39;, &#39;제안하는 추가 실험&#39; 등을 참고하여 수정하여 최종 보고서를 제출합니다.</span></b><br>&#160;</p>\n\t \t\t\t\t\t<!-- -->",
